WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.915
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.185 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:34.985 --> 01:39.025
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:42.745 --> 01:44.345
No… What are you doing?

5
01:45.265 --> 01:47.545
It was so many years ago. Nothing worth seeing.

6
01:47.625 --> 01:49.105
Why do you insist?

7
01:49.945 --> 01:52.785
She used to work right here.

8
01:56.705 --> 01:58.065
Children, take a break if you're tired.

9
01:58.145 --> 01:59.065
Take it easy.

10
02:00.145 --> 02:03.825
If I hadn't taken pity on her, who would've taken in a child?

11
02:03.905 --> 02:06.985
She could barely do any work and wasted so much of my food.

12
02:07.065 --> 02:09.584
While she lived here, she was well fed and warmly clothed.

13
02:09.665 --> 02:10.825
She had it good here.

14
02:10.905 --> 02:11.745
For our…

15
02:11.825 --> 02:12.985
Please, don't!

16
02:13.065 --> 02:15.745
Your Liu family is notorious for being stingy.

17
02:15.825 --> 02:17.745
You hire half-grown children to save on wages.

18
02:18.505 --> 02:19.745
Expect me to believe you?

19
02:19.825 --> 02:21.425
If you still won't tell the truth,

20
02:22.105 --> 02:25.865
when I get it out of someone else, I'll sever the tendons in your hands.

21
02:26.385 --> 02:28.265
Please spare me. The truth is,

22
02:28.945 --> 02:30.785
she only worked here for a year.

23
02:31.465 --> 02:33.385
She usually slept right there.

24
02:39.705 --> 02:41.785
You mistreated an eight-year-old child.

25
02:42.305 --> 02:43.145
Are you even human?

26
02:43.225 --> 02:45.145
If I hadn't taken her in,

27
02:45.225 --> 02:46.105
that little bag of bones

28
02:46.185 --> 02:47.905
would've been buried in some weed-choked grave!

29
02:48.505 --> 02:49.345
She should be thanking me!

30
02:50.305 --> 02:52.585
-If you don't believe me, I'll show you. -Lead the way!

31
02:56.585 --> 02:57.705
Thank you, My lord…

32
03:01.905 --> 03:02.745
Thank you, my dear.

33
03:15.145 --> 03:16.865
My Lady, really.

34
03:16.945 --> 03:19.825
You could've had them inspect the cellar. Why go down there yourself?

35
03:20.945 --> 03:22.385
Pitiable as the refugees are,

36
03:23.425 --> 03:24.985
yet many among them who are lazy and shifty.

37
03:25.745 --> 03:28.265
This cellar will hold food for the whole winter.

38
03:28.905 --> 03:30.105
-I have to inspect it myself. -Coming.

39
03:33.305 --> 03:34.665
All this just to survive?

40
03:35.425 --> 03:36.665
Why push yourself this far?

41
03:38.225 --> 03:39.385
I've already promised you…

42
03:40.025 --> 03:42.025
I can't rely entirely on you to protect me.

43
03:43.945 --> 03:45.865
You can't be by my side every moment.

44
03:45.945 --> 03:46.785
It's done.

45
03:46.865 --> 03:47.745
Besides,

46
03:48.905 --> 03:50.065
winters are bitterly cold.

47
03:51.705 --> 03:52.865
People freeze to death every year.

48
03:53.945 --> 03:55.185
You don't know what it's like to starve and freeze.

49
03:55.825 --> 03:56.985
Careful. Take it slow.

50
03:57.065 --> 04:01.785
One extra wheat cake could saved one more life.

51
04:10.305 --> 04:11.825
Don't think too highly of me.

52
04:12.345 --> 04:15.705
These people are the foundation of my position.

53
04:17.624 --> 04:19.705
Come on. I'll take you up the mountain.

54
04:20.305 --> 04:22.425
General Qi's trap caught a wild boar.

55
04:27.185 --> 04:28.625
Slow down.

56
04:39.945 --> 04:41.825
Let's go. Up the mountain.

57
04:43.145 --> 04:44.065
Bandit.

58
04:44.665 --> 04:45.785
I am a bandit.

59
04:46.545 --> 04:47.665
You're the only one I'm after.

60
04:48.625 --> 04:49.545
Let's go!

61
04:51.225 --> 04:52.945
My Lady!

62
04:53.025 --> 04:54.505
XIANZHUANG

63
04:54.585 --> 04:57.745
To pay off a debt, her gambling-addict father

64
04:58.265 --> 05:00.145
removed her from the lacquer workshop

65
05:00.745 --> 05:02.025
and gave her to that family.

66
05:02.105 --> 05:04.185
Their 15-year-old son had just died,

67
05:04.265 --> 05:07.025
and they wanted a young girl's body to bury with him.

68
05:07.865 --> 05:11.305
How could anyone be so heartless as to do something so cruel?

69
05:11.385 --> 05:12.225
What happened to her after?

70
05:19.865 --> 05:20.905
-Over there! -No!

71
05:20.985 --> 05:23.145
-No! Don't kill me! -Still trying to run?

72
05:23.865 --> 05:24.865
No!

73
05:29.905 --> 05:31.065
At such a young age,

74
05:31.625 --> 05:35.825
she endured the pain without making a sound.

75
05:37.865 --> 05:40.305
She pretended to be dead and fooled them all.

76
05:53.065 --> 05:55.745
People at the mill said that even in the dead of winter,

77
05:56.665 --> 05:58.145
A-Chou wore only a thin shirt.

78
05:58.825 --> 06:02.465
Her hands and feet were split open with bloody cracks.

79
06:03.025 --> 06:05.185
They'd heal, then split open again.

80
06:06.665 --> 06:07.905
She was the youngest,

81
06:07.985 --> 06:10.065
yet she worked from cockcrow until deep into the night

82
06:10.145 --> 06:12.105
and was always paid the least

83
06:13.345 --> 06:17.025
because the owner knew she had nowhere else to go.

84
06:18.545 --> 06:20.145
Everyone called her Little Mute.

85
06:20.665 --> 06:21.985
When she first came to the mill,

86
06:22.585 --> 06:23.905
she could barely speak.

87
06:25.185 --> 06:27.945
-Why couldn't she speak? -She'd been frightened into silence.

88
06:28.025 --> 06:31.425
But after narrowly escaping death and spending a year at the mill,

89
06:31.505 --> 06:33.185
her birth father, Lai Gen, found her again.

90
06:34.145 --> 06:37.185
People told her to run, but she still went back.

91
06:37.865 --> 06:40.745
Oh, why would she go back?

92
06:40.825 --> 06:43.945
She said her mother was bedridden.

93
06:44.585 --> 06:48.025
If she didn't go back to work, her younger sister would be sold too.

94
06:52.425 --> 06:56.545
Your aunt really ought to be here hearing this.

95
06:57.745 --> 07:02.105
You people forced that poor girl into all this.

96
07:02.185 --> 07:04.185
You'll pay for what you've done.

97
07:07.225 --> 07:10.225
Is that all you found? Was there anything else?

98
07:12.265 --> 07:14.665
It's been so many years. There are countless leads to follow.

99
07:16.225 --> 07:17.145
But I've found some clues

100
07:17.225 --> 07:19.785
about those who lived with her in the tenement.

101
07:21.385 --> 07:23.105
Hurry. You must hurry.

102
07:24.145 --> 07:26.385
Grandmother, pitiful as she may be, she's still an outsider.

103
07:27.305 --> 07:30.545
Why are you so concerned about A-Chou's background?

104
07:31.065 --> 07:34.825
I've already checked. Madam Qiao kept working even while pregnant

105
07:35.505 --> 07:37.185
and washed clothes by the river every day.

106
07:37.905 --> 07:40.545
The neighbors watched the child be born and grow up.

107
07:41.625 --> 07:43.465
Her household registration and age both match.

108
07:43.545 --> 07:45.425
Grandmother, what are you still suspicious of?

109
07:45.505 --> 07:47.265
I honestly don't know.

110
07:47.345 --> 07:49.945
I just can't shake this uneasiness.

111
07:51.105 --> 07:53.105
Keep investigating. Hurry and dig deeper.

112
07:53.185 --> 07:55.705
All right. I'll keep looking.

113
07:55.785 --> 07:56.665
Go.

114
08:03.705 --> 08:05.305
What do you need this for?

115
08:05.385 --> 08:08.625
Aunt Heng'e, don't ask questions. Just give it to me.

116
08:09.265 --> 08:11.465
-Jundai… -I'm not your Jundai!

117
08:11.545 --> 08:13.065
I'm Wei Rao.

118
08:14.065 --> 08:16.425
My father was a hero who died on the battlefield.

119
08:17.185 --> 08:20.505
My mother is Lady Li, His Majesty's most favored consort.

120
08:21.185 --> 08:23.745
I'm the noblest young lady in the capital!

121
08:37.024 --> 08:38.425
Don't worry, Aunt Heng'e.

122
08:40.664 --> 08:42.024
It's only a precaution.

123
08:56.945 --> 09:00.625
KITCHEN

124
09:04.705 --> 09:07.185
-Is that ginseng soup for Grandmother? -Yes.

125
09:08.105 --> 09:09.145
I'll take it from here.

126
09:15.865 --> 09:17.985
You're not needed here. Leave.

127
09:18.585 --> 09:21.305
Household rules require special care with the Dowager Lady's meals.

128
09:21.985 --> 09:23.785
I can't leave it unattended even for a moment.

129
09:33.745 --> 09:35.945
Grandmother, you haven't had much appetite lately

130
09:36.025 --> 09:37.385
and often complain of fatigue.

131
09:38.265 --> 09:40.425
This ginseng soup should be taken before your meal

132
09:40.505 --> 09:41.665
for the best effect.

133
09:42.185 --> 09:44.945
If taken afterward, its effect is greatly reduced.

134
09:54.665 --> 09:57.585
-Brother Jue? -Huo Jue, what are you doing?

135
09:58.185 --> 10:00.065
The kitchen is smoky from all the charcoal fires.

136
10:00.145 --> 10:01.465
You've always hated it and never set foot there.

137
10:02.345 --> 10:05.785
Yet today, you personally brewed Grandmother's ginseng soup.

138
10:05.865 --> 10:07.065
Why is that?

139
10:23.945 --> 10:26.105
What's wrong with doing something for my grandmother?

140
10:27.345 --> 10:28.425
Grandmother,

141
10:28.505 --> 10:30.465
I won't stay here and offend anyone further.

142
10:30.545 --> 10:32.425
-I'll take my leave. -My child…

143
10:33.385 --> 10:34.265
Rao!

144
10:38.345 --> 10:39.185
Grandmother…

145
10:39.825 --> 10:41.745
She meant well.

146
10:41.825 --> 10:46.225
Seeing that I've barely been eating and have been coughing up phlegm,

147
10:46.305 --> 10:49.585
she had the maids brew a strong ginseng soup

148
10:49.665 --> 10:51.785
with bamboo sap and ginger juice added.

149
10:51.865 --> 10:55.225
She meant well. Why are you so suspicious of her?

150
10:55.305 --> 10:56.665
Grandmother, I just…

151
10:56.745 --> 10:58.665
You've been investigating A-Chou's background every day,

152
10:59.265 --> 11:00.705
and it's making you grow suspicious, isn't it?

153
11:03.625 --> 11:06.145
Still, without any evidence,

154
11:07.385 --> 11:08.825
you shouldn't have shown your suspicions.

155
11:10.425 --> 11:11.505
It was my fault.

156
11:12.065 --> 11:13.185
I'll go apologize to her now.

157
11:18.265 --> 11:20.025
He's still young after all.

158
11:20.785 --> 11:22.145
He can't keep his composure.

159
11:34.505 --> 11:35.425
Young Master.

160
11:41.425 --> 11:43.465
Rao! Rao! What are you doing?

161
11:43.545 --> 11:44.985
Rao! Drop it!

162
11:45.065 --> 11:45.985
-Let go of me! -Give it to me!

163
11:46.585 --> 11:48.025
-Give it! Drop it! -Let go of me!

164
11:49.345 --> 11:51.065
Why do you still care what happens to me?

165
11:52.265 --> 11:53.865
Rao, I'm sorry.

166
11:53.945 --> 11:59.305
You went to investigate A-Chou's past, to see how miserable and pitiful she was.

167
11:59.385 --> 12:00.585
You've clearly begun to waver!

168
12:01.345 --> 12:02.425
Right.

169
12:02.505 --> 12:04.625
She's the pitiful one for stealing my place,

170
12:05.825 --> 12:08.945
while I'm the wicked one though I've lost everything.

171
12:09.865 --> 12:13.385
-That's not true. -Just because I'm unruly, bad-tempered,

172
12:14.065 --> 12:16.665
and not as sly and calculating as she is,

173
12:18.025 --> 12:21.345
everyone despises me and speaks ill of me.

174
12:21.425 --> 12:23.825
Even when I try to do something for Grandmother,

175
12:23.905 --> 12:25.945
you question and suspect me.

176
12:26.545 --> 12:28.865
I love Grandmother more than anyone.

177
12:28.945 --> 12:30.625
How could I ever harm her?

178
12:32.545 --> 12:34.985
Everything I do is wrong.

179
12:35.505 --> 12:39.585
Then just let me die so I never have to offend your eyes again!

180
12:40.105 --> 12:40.945
Rao,

181
12:41.465 --> 12:44.745
I lost my head for a moment. I don't know what came over me.

182
12:45.505 --> 12:48.265
I don't even know why I would have such suspicions.

183
12:49.345 --> 12:51.025
Ever since Governess Chang died,

184
12:52.585 --> 12:54.145
you may not have said anything,

185
12:55.265 --> 12:56.985
but you've been doubting me all along.

186
12:57.665 --> 13:01.305
She was a deceitful, vicious old woman. How could you believe her?

187
13:02.145 --> 13:04.025
You suspected me of poisoning Grandmother, didn't you?

188
13:05.705 --> 13:06.545
Yes.

189
13:07.945 --> 13:09.345
I did hide poison under my pillow,

190
13:10.385 --> 13:12.185
but it was meant for me.

191
13:12.705 --> 13:15.145
I'd rather end my own life

192
13:15.945 --> 13:18.745
than be despised by everyone I love!

193
13:18.825 --> 13:21.105
Rao!

194
13:21.185 --> 13:22.825
Stop it, Rao! Rao!

195
13:27.665 --> 13:30.545
Go get the physician! Hurry!

196
13:31.865 --> 13:32.825
Rao,

197
13:33.345 --> 13:35.705
forgive me. I was wrong.

198
13:36.785 --> 13:40.105
From now on, I'll believe whatever you say and never doubt you without cause again.

199
13:42.865 --> 13:43.905
Rao!

200
13:46.785 --> 13:48.225
Someone!

201
13:48.745 --> 13:50.825
Come quickly!

202
13:50.905 --> 13:52.425
ZHAOYANG PALACE

203
14:09.505 --> 14:10.345
All of you, leave.

204
14:15.705 --> 14:17.785
You said Rao tried to take her own life?

205
14:17.865 --> 14:18.705
Don't panic, Your Ladyship.

206
14:18.785 --> 14:21.105
Fortunately, Lord Huo stopped her in time.

207
14:21.185 --> 14:22.145
She swallowed very little poison.

208
14:22.825 --> 14:24.505
She's been given a licorice and bean decoction as an antidote.

209
14:24.585 --> 14:26.265
Her internal organs are unharmed.

210
14:40.225 --> 14:41.105
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

211
14:42.025 --> 14:44.185
This is all my fault.

212
14:45.345 --> 14:47.545
Rao has suffered so much,

213
14:48.945 --> 14:50.905
yet I still told her to hide and wait.

214
14:52.665 --> 14:58.305
A noble daughter of a great family forced to live in hiding…

215
14:59.985 --> 15:02.265
She must blame me, her own mother.

216
15:03.665 --> 15:05.225
Where's Madam Qiao?

217
15:05.305 --> 15:08.145
You've searched for so long. Has she been found yet?

218
15:08.665 --> 15:09.625
Your Ladyship,

219
15:09.705 --> 15:12.785
we've searched every prefecture and county around the capital.

220
15:13.305 --> 15:15.865
We've also checked the Imperial Medical Bureau and local clinics.

221
15:15.945 --> 15:17.345
But we only got word this morning.

222
15:17.425 --> 15:18.545
Two years ago,

223
15:18.625 --> 15:21.065
the retired Imperial Physician Wang Zhonglu

224
15:21.145 --> 15:23.505
was best known for treating wasting illnesses.

225
15:25.065 --> 15:27.345
-Where is he now? -Yong County.

226
15:28.105 --> 15:30.505
Turn all of Yong County upside down if you must.

227
15:30.585 --> 15:31.985
Find Madam Qiao and her daughter.

228
15:32.825 --> 15:33.785
Yes.

229
15:42.185 --> 15:44.945
Take this and give it to Rao.

230
15:45.025 --> 15:48.665
Tell her I've never forgotten what I promised her.

231
15:49.625 --> 15:51.625
Tell her to focus on recovering.

232
15:53.145 --> 15:54.865
Once she's well enough to get out of bed,

233
15:55.985 --> 15:59.705
I will have her back and make them pay.

234
16:02.025 --> 16:04.305
RADIANT BEAUTY, RARE GRACE

235
16:12.345 --> 16:14.505
A-Chou, oh A-Chou.

236
16:14.585 --> 16:18.385
You forced me to become like a stray dog, wagging my tail and begging for mercy.

237
16:19.145 --> 16:21.265
Even if I descend to the underworld,

238
16:21.785 --> 16:23.825
I won't go alone.

239
16:25.105 --> 16:27.705
I'll drag you down with me.

240
16:32.185 --> 16:33.025
Missed.

241
16:33.745 --> 16:35.625
Archery takes time to master.

242
16:35.705 --> 16:36.745
Don't rush.

243
16:37.625 --> 16:38.465
Here.

244
16:52.585 --> 16:53.865
I spend days in the barracks.

245
16:54.465 --> 16:56.065
I'm rough by nature, lacking formalities.

246
16:57.705 --> 17:00.825
If I've overstepped any boundaries, please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

247
17:01.345 --> 17:02.185
The army has been busy lately,

248
17:03.185 --> 17:05.065
so I may not be able to come for some time.

249
17:05.145 --> 17:07.865
If you want to learn archery, I know a woman archer.

250
17:07.944 --> 17:09.385
I'll have her teach you instead. That would be more appropriate.

251
17:10.105 --> 17:12.145
Thank you, General. I was thinking the same thing.

252
17:14.464 --> 17:15.785
Come see how the training is going.

253
17:16.505 --> 17:17.545
They're finally starting to shape up.

254
17:24.345 --> 17:25.464
-Are you all right? -Unacceptable!

255
17:25.545 --> 17:27.424
Whose child behaves so poorly?

256
17:27.505 --> 17:29.305
The training ground is no place to run around!

257
17:30.105 --> 17:31.985
Forgive us, Your Ladyship!

258
17:32.065 --> 17:33.585
That careless fool.

259
17:34.945 --> 17:35.985
Your Ladyship,

260
17:36.065 --> 17:38.505
her husband broke his leg while hunting in the mountains.

261
17:38.585 --> 17:40.025
The family had no way to make a living,

262
17:40.105 --> 17:42.025
so we let her stay and do laundry for the estate.

263
17:42.625 --> 17:44.105
Hurry and apologize!

264
17:44.185 --> 17:45.545
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

265
17:45.625 --> 17:47.105
Blades have no eyes.

266
17:47.185 --> 17:49.225
Watch the child. Don't let him get hurt.

267
17:49.305 --> 17:50.345
Bitao.

268
17:52.305 --> 17:53.145
Try some.

269
18:05.465 --> 18:07.585
You're far too noble for this, Your Ladyship.

270
18:07.665 --> 18:09.785
It's an honor for them. Quick, kowtow to Her Ladyship!

271
18:10.385 --> 18:11.305
No need.

272
18:13.265 --> 18:14.385
These two children…

273
18:15.145 --> 18:16.265
Oh, they're twins.

274
18:17.105 --> 18:17.945
Quite an adorable pair.

275
18:19.385 --> 18:21.505
Don't be afraid. It's a gift from Her Ladyship.

276
18:21.585 --> 18:22.625
Just accept it.

277
18:24.665 --> 18:26.385
Here, take them all.

278
18:28.985 --> 18:30.385
-Come on. -Hurry. Let's go.

279
18:30.465 --> 18:32.145
Don't come running in here again.

280
18:33.185 --> 18:34.185
General Qi,

281
18:36.705 --> 18:39.265
in this world, can two people really look so alike?

282
18:39.345 --> 18:42.905
Women carrying twins have often seen

283
18:42.985 --> 18:43.865
both mother and child lost.

284
18:44.865 --> 18:48.345
That's why twins are rare. Rare, but not unheard of.

285
18:48.425 --> 18:49.625
Those two just now were twins, weren't they?

286
18:49.705 --> 18:50.545
What if they aren't twins?

287
18:51.585 --> 18:53.305
If two people are neither kin nor connected,

288
18:53.385 --> 18:54.825
yet happen to look alike,

289
18:55.345 --> 18:57.665
then it's fate playing tricks, a coincidence.

290
18:58.545 --> 18:59.545
Fate?

291
19:02.145 --> 19:03.705
Could fate really arrange such a coincidence?

292
19:06.145 --> 19:09.905
Two complete strangers who aren't related by blood at all…

293
19:13.225 --> 19:14.345
How could they look so alike?

294
19:16.825 --> 19:17.905
Why?

295
19:20.865 --> 19:21.705
Your Ladyship,

296
19:21.785 --> 19:23.985
one of Lady Li's attendants is heading toward Yong County.

297
19:32.265 --> 19:34.945
General Qi, I need the men you've been training.

298
19:36.225 --> 19:37.585
They've only trained for a few days.

299
19:37.665 --> 19:39.465
They may look orderly, but they're full of weaknesses.

300
19:40.225 --> 19:41.865
Against a well-trained army,

301
19:41.945 --> 19:44.745
they'd be swept aside, unable to even put up a fight.

302
19:44.825 --> 19:47.505
If you need a hand, I'll assign you some others.

303
19:47.585 --> 19:49.625
No. I can't use your men

304
19:50.505 --> 19:51.745
or the Lu family's.

305
19:53.265 --> 19:56.225
Besides, one can only learn to farm by getting into the field.

306
19:58.145 --> 19:59.785
What good is training in a drill yard?

307
20:00.865 --> 20:02.145
They need real experience.

308
20:12.185 --> 20:13.305
Mother!

309
20:18.945 --> 20:20.625
Please! Spare me!

310
20:20.705 --> 20:22.025
I… I've paid off all my gambling debts.

311
20:22.105 --> 20:23.585
-I don't owe a single coin! -No.

312
20:23.665 --> 20:25.305
-Don't take me. -General, what's going on?

313
20:27.585 --> 20:28.905
Mother. Hongxian.

314
20:28.985 --> 20:32.065
You good-for-nothing. All you do is drink and gamble.

315
20:32.145 --> 20:33.105
Now look, you've brought them right to us!

316
20:33.705 --> 20:35.825
-Take them all away! -I'm innocent!

317
20:35.905 --> 20:37.505
I'm innocent!

318
20:37.585 --> 20:39.225
I'm innocent!

319
20:45.265 --> 20:46.225
Who are you people?

320
20:46.305 --> 20:48.505
-Why are you taking us? -Keep quiet.

321
20:49.025 --> 20:50.745
Settle down and stop causing trouble.

322
20:55.585 --> 20:58.225
Deputy General Zhao, my stomach's acting up. I need to go!

323
20:58.905 --> 21:00.825
-Me too. -I can't hold it either!

324
21:00.905 --> 21:01.665
-What's going on? -Move!

325
21:01.745 --> 21:02.825
Pull yourselves together!

326
21:02.905 --> 21:04.145
It must've been that tea stall we passed.

327
21:04.225 --> 21:06.465
Someone must've tampered with the tea.

328
21:06.545 --> 21:07.745
What?

329
21:10.425 --> 21:11.265
‎Go there.

330
21:19.505 --> 21:21.985
Someone's attacking the carriage! Guards! Guards!

331
21:28.745 --> 21:29.785
‎Don't try anything!

332
21:32.265 --> 21:33.065
We've got them all.

333
21:36.985 --> 21:38.545
-Don't kill me! -Don't kill me! Please!

334
21:38.625 --> 21:39.465
-Don't kill me! -Mother. Hongxian.

335
21:41.745 --> 21:44.985
A-Chou? Mother, A-Chou came to save us!

336
21:45.065 --> 21:47.025
Your Ladyship, I drugged them all.

337
21:47.105 --> 21:48.545
-Didn't I do a fine job? -Get down!

338
21:48.625 --> 21:49.905
You get the greatest credit.

339
21:51.185 --> 21:53.225
For this victory, every man under my command

340
21:53.745 --> 21:56.105
gets 100 coins and a bolt of silk.

341
21:56.185 --> 21:57.025
From now on,

342
21:57.105 --> 21:59.025
a dou of fine rice and a plate of meat will be added to every meal!

343
21:59.825 --> 22:01.505
Your Ladyship prevails!

344
22:01.585 --> 22:03.065
Your Ladyship prevails!

345
22:03.145 --> 22:05.025
Your Ladyship prevails!

346
22:05.105 --> 22:06.345
Your Ladyship prevails!

347
22:09.585 --> 22:11.785
Physician Wang truly works wonders.

348
22:11.865 --> 22:13.265
You look so much better, Mother.

349
22:13.905 --> 22:14.905
A-Chou,

350
22:15.465 --> 22:17.825
looking at you now, I can barely recognize you.

351
22:23.185 --> 22:24.265
There's so much good food here.

352
22:24.865 --> 22:26.705
How could the two of us finish it all?

353
22:26.785 --> 22:28.185
Why not call your brother and sister over

354
22:29.345 --> 22:31.065
so the whole family can be together?

355
22:31.145 --> 22:33.905
They've been frightened half to death and are covered in dirt.

356
22:33.985 --> 22:35.145
They're in quite a state.

357
22:35.665 --> 22:37.385
I had someone take them to wash up.

358
22:38.385 --> 22:39.385
Food will be prepared for them.

359
22:39.985 --> 22:42.945
Your brother loves drinking. Someone needs to keep an eye on him.

360
22:43.825 --> 22:46.505
And Hongxian was scared out of her wits. I'd better go check on them.

361
22:46.585 --> 22:49.665
We haven't seen each other in so long, yet you haven't even said you missed me.

362
22:49.745 --> 22:51.865
All you talk about is Hongxian and Runsheng.

363
22:51.945 --> 22:52.905
You're playing favorites.

364
22:53.505 --> 22:55.545
Are those two the only ones you care about?

365
22:55.625 --> 22:56.745
What about me, your daughter?

366
22:59.665 --> 23:01.265
I think about you every day.

367
23:02.225 --> 23:05.305
But of my three children, you're the oldest.

368
23:05.985 --> 23:09.505
You're smart and sensible, so I worry about you the least.

369
23:09.585 --> 23:10.785
Those two are different.

370
23:10.865 --> 23:12.145
The moment I take my eyes off them, there's trouble.

371
23:12.225 --> 23:14.745
There are so many people around this estate.

372
23:15.265 --> 23:18.985
I'm just afraid… afraid they'll cause trouble for you.

373
23:23.305 --> 23:24.145
Is that so?

374
23:28.745 --> 23:29.785
My daughter,

375
23:30.545 --> 23:31.785
it's been a while.

376
23:31.865 --> 23:33.905
You've changed so much.

377
23:35.425 --> 23:36.545
How have I changed?

378
23:37.145 --> 23:38.465
I can't quite put it into words.

379
23:39.185 --> 23:42.025
You've become more imposing and more formidable.

380
23:42.945 --> 23:46.225
And the way you speak and act is nothing like before.

381
23:46.305 --> 23:47.705
I'm just a poor old woman.

382
23:48.385 --> 23:50.265
Even I feel a little intimidated by you now.

383
23:51.305 --> 23:52.585
I can hardly recognize you.

384
23:53.825 --> 23:57.385
No matter how much I change, I'll always be your daughter.

385
24:03.905 --> 24:04.945
This…

386
24:05.585 --> 24:07.225
Is someone else joining us?

387
24:09.825 --> 24:12.185
An old acquaintance wants to catch up with you.

388
24:14.465 --> 24:15.625
The Grand Military Review takes place once every three years.

389
24:15.705 --> 24:17.825
Every unit is doing all it can to distinguish itself before His Majesty.

390
24:17.905 --> 24:19.145
You have trainings first thing tomorrow morning.

391
24:19.225 --> 24:22.065
You said you'd stay at the barracks, yet you came rushing back again.

392
24:23.545 --> 24:25.505
Are you afraid Her Ladyship might run away?

393
24:27.465 --> 24:29.345
I spoke out of turn. I deserve this.

394
24:29.945 --> 24:30.905
Who is that woman?

395
24:39.425 --> 24:42.105
Go find out who Her Ladyship invited tonight.

396
24:42.825 --> 24:43.705
Yes.

397
24:55.585 --> 24:57.905
It's been a long time. I hope you've been well.

398
24:57.985 --> 25:00.385
I pay my respects to Your Ladyship.

399
25:02.545 --> 25:03.585
Oh my.

400
25:04.145 --> 25:06.465
How could I let Your Ladyship serve me wine?

401
25:07.745 --> 25:09.625
This is too much of an honor for me.

402
25:10.785 --> 25:12.025
How could I forget my roots?

403
25:12.665 --> 25:14.705
When Han Liao deliberately stirred up trouble,

404
25:15.225 --> 25:17.345
if you hadn't acted so cleverly to help me, Governess Liu,

405
25:17.425 --> 25:18.505
how could I have everything today?

406
25:19.305 --> 25:21.465
Afterward, to stay out of trouble,

407
25:22.065 --> 25:24.625
you had to keep hiding from place to place.

408
25:24.705 --> 25:26.305
I've always felt guilty about that.

409
25:27.385 --> 25:29.345
I should have toasted you long ago.

410
25:30.905 --> 25:31.825
Here's to you, Governess Liu.

411
25:36.385 --> 25:38.745
Even a crafty rabbit has three burrows, doesn't it?

412
25:38.825 --> 25:41.545
With all the money you gave me, changing my hideout from time to time

413
25:41.625 --> 25:42.745
is no big deal.

414
25:42.825 --> 25:46.185
If you hadn't invite me here, I wouldn't have shown my face.

415
25:47.065 --> 25:49.705
I knew from the start you were destined for greater things.

416
25:50.465 --> 25:52.905
So all my efforts to cover for you weren't wasted.

417
25:53.945 --> 25:55.385
You know how to repay a kindness.

418
25:56.065 --> 25:57.465
Come on. Let's drink one more bowl!

419
26:02.385 --> 26:06.385
Wei Rao, what exactly are you planning?

420
26:06.985 --> 26:07.825
Let me toast you again.

421
26:10.185 --> 26:11.305
Here.

422
26:18.785 --> 26:22.905
Just look at you, so dignified and elegant.

423
26:24.065 --> 26:26.745
Madam Qiao, with a daughter like this,

424
26:26.825 --> 26:28.745
you'll enjoy a life of comfort!

425
26:29.905 --> 26:31.905
Too much to drink and you start talking nonsense.

426
26:31.985 --> 26:33.945
What if someone overhears you?

427
26:34.025 --> 26:35.305
Why not take her to bed?

428
26:35.385 --> 26:37.265
A generous gift tomorrow to thank her.

429
26:39.345 --> 26:41.905
There's no rush. There are no outsiders here.

430
26:43.145 --> 26:45.705
What's the harm in talking a little longer?

431
26:47.705 --> 26:50.945
When I was little, my father often beat and berated me.

432
26:51.465 --> 26:53.305
I thought I wouldn't live past eight.

433
26:54.465 --> 26:55.705
Who'd have thought it'd come to this?

434
26:56.945 --> 27:01.345
It just shows that no one can predict what life has in store.

435
27:04.145 --> 27:05.665
Exactly.

436
27:05.745 --> 27:08.705
That heartless father of yours abandoned you in the mountains,

437
27:08.785 --> 27:10.985
thinking the wolves would carry you off.

438
27:11.745 --> 27:15.385
"Survive a great calamity, and better days will come."

439
27:15.465 --> 27:17.265
That saying came true for you.

440
27:20.225 --> 27:21.345
That really happened?

441
27:22.105 --> 27:22.945
How come I never knew?

442
27:23.025 --> 27:25.785
You were only two then.

443
27:26.305 --> 27:27.265
How could you remember?

444
27:28.105 --> 27:31.065
That scoundrel lost money gambling

445
27:31.905 --> 27:32.945
and blamed you for bringing him bad luck.

446
27:33.705 --> 27:37.625
When I wasn't looking, he secretly carried you away and abandoned you.

447
27:39.505 --> 27:41.385
My Lord, keep it down.

448
27:41.465 --> 27:44.145
That night, your mother came back from washing clothes.

449
27:44.225 --> 27:47.225
When she couldn't find you, she went frantic.

450
27:47.305 --> 27:50.145
She wouldn't listen to any of us

451
27:50.225 --> 27:53.505
and ran into the mountains alone to look for you.

452
27:54.225 --> 27:56.585
A-Chou! A-Chou!

453
27:59.465 --> 28:00.545
A-Chou!

454
28:01.825 --> 28:02.865
A-Chou!

455
28:06.185 --> 28:06.945
A-Chou!

456
28:07.625 --> 28:09.025
Go away!

457
28:10.745 --> 28:11.985
A-Chou…

458
28:24.305 --> 28:25.905
In this whole world,

459
28:26.425 --> 28:32.385
only a mother would dare fight wolves for her child.

460
28:32.465 --> 28:35.225
When your mother came down the mountain the next day,

461
28:35.305 --> 28:39.185
her whole body was covered in wounds.

462
28:39.705 --> 28:43.465
A wolf even tore a chunk of flesh from here.

463
28:43.545 --> 28:47.265
But she held you tight and wouldn't let go.

464
28:47.345 --> 28:51.465
No one could separate the two of you.

465
28:51.545 --> 28:56.185
I'll never forget this moment for the rest of my life.

466
29:14.305 --> 29:15.905
So these scars on your arm

467
29:17.705 --> 29:19.225
were all because of me.

468
29:20.505 --> 29:24.025
I thought you didn't care about me, that you didn't love me.

469
29:24.625 --> 29:26.305
You did all that for me.

470
29:27.705 --> 29:29.425
Why did you never tell me?

471
29:33.785 --> 29:35.665
I was weak and couldn't protect you.

472
29:36.385 --> 29:38.425
It was all my fault.

473
29:40.225 --> 29:41.905
I failed you.

474
29:45.185 --> 29:46.665
I'm sorry, my child.

475
29:47.865 --> 29:50.185
I made you suffer so much

476
29:50.985 --> 29:53.105
and shouldered the burden of this whole family.

477
29:53.745 --> 29:56.065
Even now, we're still dragging you down.

478
29:57.585 --> 29:59.905
It breaks my heart.

479
30:06.105 --> 30:10.505
Why did you never tell me how much you were suffering inside?

480
30:13.265 --> 30:14.785
I never wanted much.

481
30:16.025 --> 30:18.105
What you've given me has always been enough.

482
30:21.305 --> 30:22.545
Governess Liu is drunk.

483
30:23.305 --> 30:25.345
Let me take you back to rest.

484
30:25.425 --> 30:28.385
You two have a good talk.

485
30:28.945 --> 30:29.865
What fine wine!

486
30:30.385 --> 30:33.145
A wolf tore a chunk of flesh right off…

487
30:36.785 --> 30:37.625
Mother,

488
30:38.825 --> 30:40.505
Hongxian said she missed me.

489
30:41.025 --> 30:43.385
I've settled her in the west wing room.

490
30:44.585 --> 30:45.825
Why don't you move there too?

491
30:46.505 --> 30:48.385
I've been traveling for days. I'm tired.

492
30:49.225 --> 30:50.545
I don't want to keep moving around.

493
30:51.585 --> 30:53.065
This room is perfectly fine.

494
30:54.145 --> 30:56.425
You sisters should spend some time together.

495
30:57.625 --> 30:59.065
-Okay? -Sure.

496
31:02.865 --> 31:04.305
Whatever you say, Mother.

497
31:39.465 --> 31:40.545
You're back, my dear?

498
31:42.385 --> 31:43.425
Why are your eyes red?

499
31:45.985 --> 31:47.385
Have you had dinner yet?

500
31:47.905 --> 31:48.865
I'll have someone prepare it.

501
31:50.705 --> 31:53.345
Don't bother. His Majesty will inspect the troops during the winter hunt.

502
31:55.825 --> 31:58.705
There's still much to do at the barracks. I'll pack a few things and leave.

503
32:00.065 --> 32:01.705
Then I'll pack for you.

504
32:07.545 --> 32:09.625
Here. Put this on. It's cold at night.

505
32:14.865 --> 32:17.905
I'm leaving Zhao Song and Zhao Bai here. If you need anything, just tell them.

506
32:19.945 --> 32:21.025
Okay, I know.

507
32:22.665 --> 32:23.545
Good night.

508
32:33.905 --> 32:35.505
From what she said in there just now,

509
32:36.345 --> 32:38.745
she seems to doubt about her own origins.

510
32:41.185 --> 32:42.185
My… My Lord,

511
32:42.265 --> 32:45.185
weren't you staying here tonight? Why did you suddenly change your mind?

512
32:45.265 --> 32:46.265
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

513
32:46.345 --> 32:47.665
Go find someone from the Wei family for me.

514
32:47.745 --> 32:49.105
Who are you looking for at the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence?

515
32:50.585 --> 32:52.385
No. Not the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

516
32:52.985 --> 32:55.545
Go to the Court of Justice. I'll go there myself.

517
32:57.305 --> 33:00.225
My Lord! What are you going to the Court of Justice for, My Lord?

518
33:03.065 --> 33:04.225
I was such a fool.

519
33:06.425 --> 33:08.585
How could I doubt my own mother?

520
33:13.265 --> 33:14.705
If she weren't my birth mother,

521
33:17.025 --> 33:19.345
why would she fight wolves to save my life?

522
33:22.305 --> 33:23.465
I was so foolish.

523
33:25.065 --> 33:26.225
Your Ladyship,

524
33:26.745 --> 33:29.905
the silkworm house is ready. You can inspect it when you have time.

525
33:30.545 --> 33:33.465
You said the soldiers should be divided into three ranks,

526
33:33.545 --> 33:36.505
with different pay and meals for each.

527
33:37.025 --> 33:38.825
Mr. Feng has drafted the regulations.

528
33:38.905 --> 33:41.065
Once you've reviewed them, we'll post them.

529
33:41.145 --> 33:42.785
The fruit tree saplings have arrived too.

530
33:42.865 --> 33:44.225
It's getting late.

531
33:45.465 --> 33:47.225
There's plenty to do tomorrow.

532
33:48.425 --> 33:49.785
You should get some sleep.

533
33:50.905 --> 33:53.385
Yes, it's late.

534
33:58.345 --> 33:59.585
Time to rest.

535
34:09.105 --> 34:10.865
Oh, no! Fire!

536
34:10.945 --> 34:12.425
-Fire! -Fire!

537
34:12.505 --> 34:14.225
-Put it out! -Oh, no!

538
34:14.304 --> 34:17.505
-Put out the fire! -Hurry!

539
34:17.585 --> 34:18.505
Help!

540
34:18.585 --> 34:20.145
Hurry!

541
34:20.225 --> 34:22.185
Save Her Ladyship! Hurry!

542
34:23.304 --> 34:24.264
Help!

543
34:24.905 --> 34:26.264
Her Ladyship is still inside!

544
34:26.344 --> 34:28.385
-Her Ladyship's room is on fire! -Help!

545
34:28.465 --> 34:29.905
-Someone, help! -Hongxian!

546
34:29.985 --> 34:30.985
Put out the fire!

547
34:31.065 --> 34:33.304
-Hongxian! -Her Ladyship is still inside!

548
34:34.264 --> 34:35.264
Fire!

549
34:36.185 --> 34:38.585
-Fire! -Fire!

550
34:38.665 --> 34:40.465
Get more water!

551
34:40.545 --> 34:42.585
-Hurry! -Help!

552
34:42.665 --> 34:43.865
-Hongxian! -Help!

553
34:44.385 --> 34:46.225
-Hongxian! -Hurry!

554
34:46.304 --> 34:48.145
-Hongxian! -Water's here!

555
34:48.744 --> 34:50.025
Bring the water!

556
34:51.225 --> 34:52.065
Hongxian!

557
34:52.145 --> 34:53.425
-Get them out! -Hurry!

558
34:54.065 --> 34:55.425
-Hurry! -Hongxian!

559
34:56.465 --> 34:58.945
-Hurry! -Get them out!

560
34:59.505 --> 35:00.865
-Someone, help! -Water's here!

561
35:00.945 --> 35:02.625
Get them out!

562
35:03.225 --> 35:04.065
Fire!

563
35:05.505 --> 35:07.465
Fire over here!

564
35:07.985 --> 35:09.025
Get more water!

565
35:09.625 --> 35:11.665
-Hurry! -Get more water!

566
35:14.265 --> 35:15.625
Hurry!

567
35:28.185 --> 35:30.025
Have you forgotten…

568
35:32.025 --> 35:33.745
that you have another daughter?

569
35:47.225 --> 35:48.865
I'm not your daughter.

570
35:51.465 --> 35:52.825
Then who am I?

571
35:57.065 --> 35:58.865
Who am I?

572
36:08.825 --> 36:10.305
That foolish maid

573
36:10.385 --> 36:12.385
knocked over a candlestick on night watch.

574
36:12.465 --> 36:14.465
Luckily, you woke up in time, so it didn't turn into a disaster.

575
36:15.345 --> 36:16.825
They were all running around in a panic.

576
36:16.905 --> 36:17.945
How could anyone put out the fire like that?

577
36:18.025 --> 36:19.785
They were only getting in the way.

578
36:20.625 --> 36:23.065
You got to sort them out. Don't let it slide.

579
36:23.665 --> 36:24.585
Stop bothering your sister.

580
36:25.425 --> 36:26.265
She's busy.

581
36:27.065 --> 36:28.025
Mother,

582
36:28.105 --> 36:30.465
A-Chou said now that we're in the capital, we don't need to leave again.

583
36:31.105 --> 36:33.105
We'll live here from now on.

584
36:33.185 --> 36:36.505
She also said she'd find me a good teacher to teach me music and dance.

585
36:37.385 --> 36:39.225
We'll never have to hide from place to place

586
36:39.305 --> 36:40.225
or live in fear again.

587
36:40.945 --> 36:44.345
I've always wanted to learn to dance, but I could never afford the tuition.

588
36:45.225 --> 36:46.305
-Now A-Chou can… -Enough!

589
36:47.665 --> 36:48.505
Stop talking.

590
36:53.145 --> 36:55.425
Mother's tired. You should get some rest too.

591
37:11.945 --> 37:12.865
A-Chou,

592
37:14.665 --> 37:16.425
I hope you won't be so cruel

593
37:17.265 --> 37:21.185
as to take revenge on us once you learn the truth about your birth.

594
37:21.945 --> 37:23.945
I was the only one at fault.

595
37:24.025 --> 37:25.705
Nothing to do with Hongxian and Runsheng.

596
37:25.785 --> 37:26.985
Please spare them, all right?

597
37:32.105 --> 37:33.385
I'm heartless?

598
37:37.585 --> 37:39.305
Because you had tuberculosis,

599
37:40.305 --> 37:43.865
I became an apprentice at a lacquer workshop when I was only six.

600
37:45.305 --> 37:47.865
Then Father sold me into a ghost marriage.

601
37:48.985 --> 37:52.665
I barely escaped with my life, but I still came back.

602
37:53.625 --> 37:54.825
I was afraid.

603
37:56.145 --> 37:57.985
I was afraid that if I escaped alone,

604
37:59.945 --> 38:01.385
you would be beaten,

605
38:02.345 --> 38:03.625
and my siblings would be sold.

606
38:04.585 --> 38:06.385
I worked myself to the bone.

607
38:08.625 --> 38:11.585
I'd rather gnaw on tree bark or cut flesh from my own body…

608
38:13.865 --> 38:15.545
than ever let any of you go hungry.

609
38:17.065 --> 38:18.425
But what did you do, Mother?

610
38:18.505 --> 38:21.025
You watched me get beaten and sold.

611
38:21.545 --> 38:24.665
I was treated like an animal, suffering day and night,

612
38:24.745 --> 38:27.865
yet you never told me a single word of the truth.

613
38:33.785 --> 38:35.425
You just told me to accept my fate…

614
38:38.145 --> 38:41.705
that I was born into poverty and destined for a life of suffering.

615
38:42.785 --> 38:44.105
You told me to endure it,

616
38:44.185 --> 38:46.665
persuade me into sacrificing myself for your own children.

617
38:46.745 --> 38:48.185
And now…

618
38:51.585 --> 38:54.065
you're calling me heartless?

619
38:59.345 --> 39:01.865
A-Chou, I shouldn't have said that.

620
39:01.945 --> 39:04.145
I was wrong. Please forgive me.

621
39:05.105 --> 39:07.385
If you feel even the slightest guilt,

622
39:08.825 --> 39:10.625
tell me the truth.

623
39:22.945 --> 39:23.985
That night,

624
39:24.945 --> 39:26.665
I did drive the wolves away…

625
39:28.665 --> 39:32.665
but my child had already frozen to death.

626
39:33.745 --> 39:36.305
I buried her on the mountain.

627
40:06.225 --> 40:08.025
My A-Chou, I…

628
40:12.745 --> 40:13.585
A-Chou.

629
40:15.145 --> 40:16.185
A-Chou. A-Chou.

630
40:17.105 --> 40:19.065
Don't cry. Don't cry.

631
40:19.145 --> 40:21.185
Then I found you.

632
40:44.865 --> 40:46.985
I took off my coat and wrapped you in them…

633
40:49.065 --> 40:51.545
then slipped home with you in the dead of night.

634
40:53.625 --> 40:55.305
How did no one notice?

635
40:56.145 --> 41:00.185
To a poor family, a two-year-old child is no more noticed than a cat or dog.

636
41:01.625 --> 41:06.225
Even their own father wouldn't look twice, let alone outsiders.

637
41:07.665 --> 41:11.905
I said you were my own daughter, and no one ever questioned it.

638
41:14.545 --> 41:18.265
Then where are the clothes I was wearing and the keepsakes that came with me?

639
41:27.305 --> 41:28.385
Bitao,

640
41:29.905 --> 41:31.665
Runsheng was dead drunk.

641
41:32.305 --> 41:34.225
He didn't even wake up when the fire broke out.

642
41:35.785 --> 41:37.225
Go see if he's awake yet.

643
41:37.305 --> 41:38.305
Yes.

644
41:38.385 --> 41:40.265
No, please don't!

645
41:42.545 --> 41:43.585
I'll tell you.

646
41:44.225 --> 41:45.985
They're hidden under the stove at our old home.

647
41:48.105 --> 41:51.025
A-Chou, I did lie to you,

648
41:51.105 --> 41:52.585
but if I hadn't took you off that mountain,

649
41:52.665 --> 41:53.985
you would've frozen to death.

650
41:55.745 --> 41:57.905
For the sake of my saving you,

651
41:58.425 --> 42:00.465
please spare your brother and sister.

652
42:01.105 --> 42:03.305
Blame me if you must. Hate me if you must.

653
42:03.385 --> 42:04.785
Take it all out on me.

654
42:04.865 --> 42:06.345
They know nothing about this.

655
42:06.945 --> 42:10.265
Please spare them. I'm begging you.

656
42:14.185 --> 42:15.025
A-Chou,

657
42:16.465 --> 42:19.385
that night, I lost my daughter,

658
42:20.385 --> 42:22.825
and your parents abandoned you on the mountain.

659
42:23.665 --> 42:25.465
They were the ones who cast you aside.

660
42:26.145 --> 42:29.065
You were fated to become my daughter.

661
42:29.665 --> 42:32.305
Yes, I was selfish back then.

662
42:32.385 --> 42:33.945
I made you suffer

663
42:34.025 --> 42:37.145
through endless hardship. I know I was wrong.

664
42:37.665 --> 42:39.625
From now on, we can all stay together.

665
42:40.145 --> 42:41.905
I'll make it up to you a thousand times over.

666
42:41.985 --> 42:43.065
All right?

667
42:48.745 --> 42:49.745
Mother…

668
42:52.025 --> 42:55.585
for more than a decade, I've been repaying you for saving my life.

669
42:56.745 --> 42:58.305
Was that still not enough?

670
43:05.145 --> 43:07.945
A-Chou!

671
43:10.225 --> 43:12.505
I was never your A-Chou!

672
43:31.025 --> 43:33.545
My Lord, Her Ladyship sent everyone away.

673
43:33.625 --> 43:36.265
She's been in there alone for an hour.

674
43:38.505 --> 43:39.345
Break the door down.

675
43:40.905 --> 43:42.185
But…

676
43:42.785 --> 43:43.785
Open it.

677
43:44.385 --> 43:45.225
Yes.

678
44:21.025 --> 44:22.385
Why are you still hesitating?

679
44:26.225 --> 44:28.905
I already know everything I need to know.

680
44:30.425 --> 44:33.465
Since you've made up your mind, you should see it through.

681
44:36.105 --> 44:39.865
You need to be more decisive.

682
46:32.025 --> 46:34.385
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

683
46:35.545 --> 46:36.545
There's someone…

684
46:39.065 --> 46:40.225
I'd like you to meet.

685
49:02.705 --> 49:05.105
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
